You are working inside a self-hosted Plane CE source tree.

GOAL

Implement Microsoft Teams notifications for Plane CE.

Do NOT hardcode logic into issue creation handlers.

Build a reusable notification/event architecture that can later support:

- Microsoft Teams
- Email
- N8N
- Slack
- Zalo OA
- Future integrations

====================================================
BUSINESS CONTEXT
====================================================

This is a self-hosted enterprise deployment.

Current stack:

- Plane CE
- PostgreSQL
- Redis
- RabbitMQ
- Keycloak
- Active Directory

Organization uses Microsoft Teams.

Primary objective:

Whenever important activities occur in Plane,
Microsoft Teams channels should receive rich notifications.

====================================================
PHASE 1 EVENTS
====================================================

Implement notifications for:

Issue Created
Issue Assigned
Issue Updated
Issue Completed
Comment Added

Cycle Started
Cycle Completed

Project Created

====================================================
ARCHITECTURE
====================================================

Create a notification abstraction layer.

Example:

NotificationProvider

TeamsProvider

NotificationManager

Do not couple Teams logic directly inside issue workflows.

Event Flow:

Issue Event
↓
NotificationManager
↓
TeamsProvider
↓
Incoming Webhook

