Do not fail Plane operations.

Log:

notification_failure

Retry using existing queue/worker mechanisms if possible.

====================================================
SECURITY
====================================================

Never expose webhook URL in UI.

Webhook URL stored only in environment variables.

Sanitize issue description content before sending.

